  "id": "ion-pump",
  "term": "ion pump",
  "definition": "In this context, an ion pump refers to the astrocyte α2 form of the Na+/K+-ATPase, a protein involved in regulating sodium and potassium ions. The packet describes this ion pump as important in amyotrophic lateral sclerosis, with changes in its activity affecting SOD1 aggregation, disease onset, and survival-related molecular pathways.",
